  "body": "- Setup offers a 30-day Cloud Sync trial without a credit card. People installing directly or with an agent can choose a private, signed-in My Work view. Explicit local and custom sync settings are preserved.\n- The cloud viewer uses the current account to load synced work, evidence and review changes. Returning to a tab verifies the signed-in account before showing its contents. Retrying a save after a lost response reuses the same action ID.\n- During the trial, My Work offers optional guidance for trying cross-agent sync and shows when to add a payment method to continue.",
